<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exīlĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		exilis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>thinness</i>, <i>meagreness</i>, <i>weakness</i>, <i>poorness</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aculei apum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 2, 1, § 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foliorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					24, 19, 118, § 178</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">soli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					18, 16, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">femineae vocis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 11, 1</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 11, 3, 19</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quarundam litterarum (opp. pinguitudo),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					1, 11, 4</span></i>
			 —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of speech, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in dicendo (opp. ubertatem et copiam),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					de Or. 1, 12, 50</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 82, 284</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
